      "defines exact admissibility as unique solvability of K_II X = K_IB",
      "does not select M001 or any other cut",
      "does not construct K from C005 conductances or choose out-degree/in-degree sign convention",
      "does not prove the canonical M001 interior admissible; that is M002",
      "does not define the inter-birth directed response R_n; that is C007",
      "does not symmetrize, regularize, threshold, pseudoinvert, or use floating conditioning"
    ]
